---
import '../styles/components/AttackDemo.css';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
interface Props {compact?:boolean;}
const {compact=false}=Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={['attack-demo','graph-demo',{compact}]} data-demo>
 <div class="demo-top"><div class="demo-brand"><img src="/brand/tracegate-mark.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22"/>Security graph<span class="graph-divider"></span><span class="graph-workspace">Tracegate / Sandbox</span></div><span class="demo-synthetic">Synthetic environment</span></div>
 <div class="demo-controls" role="group" aria-label="Sample attack paths"><button class="active" data-path="cloud" aria-pressed="true"><Icon name="cloud" size={15}/>Cloud exposure</button><button data-path="identity" aria-pressed="false"><Icon name="fingerprint" size={15}/>Identity access</button><button data-path="delivery" aria-pressed="false"><Icon name="git-branch" size={15}/>Delivery pipeline</button></div>
 <div class="demo-body"><div class="path-visual graph-visual"><div class="graph-toolbar"><span><span class="status-mark"></span>Path to a critical asset</span><button class="graph-tour-trigger" data-tour-start aria-expanded="false"><Icon name="player-play" size={12}/>Guided tour</button></div><div class="path-background" aria-hidden="true"></div>
 <div class="graph-canvas"><svg class="graph-connections" viewBox="0 0 800 340" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><g class="context-edges"><path d="M100 175 C150 175 160 45 235 45 S320 90 400 90 M100 175 C170 175 230 290 315 290 S380 230 400 90 M400 90 C480 90 525 40 570 40 S650 100 700 175 M400 90 C480 90 550 280 620 280 S665 230 700 175"/><path d="M235 45 315 290 M570 40 620 280"/></g><path class="main-edge" d="M100 175 C220 175 220 90 400 90"/><path class="main-edge intervention-edge" d="M400 90 C565 90 570 175 700 175"/><circle class="flow-packet" r="4"><animateMotion dur="5s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M100 175 C220 175 220 90 400 90 C565 90 570 175 700 175"/></circle></svg>
 <div class="context-node cn-one" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="server" size={16}/></div><div class="context-node cn-two" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="code" size={16}/></div><div class="context-node cn-three" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="cloud" size={16}/></div><div class="context-node cn-four" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="users" size={16}/></div>
 <button class="graph-node gn-one" data-inspect="0" aria-pressed="false"><span class="node-icon"><Icon name="world" size={25}/></span><span class="meta" data-node-type="0">ENTRY POINT</span><strong data-node-label="0">Public workload</strong><span class="node-hint">Inspect exposure<Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={11}/></span></button>
 <button class="graph-node gn-two selected" data-inspect="1" aria-pressed="true"><span class="node-icon"><Icon name="key" size={25}/></span><span class="meta" data-node-type="1">PERMISSION</span><strong data-node-label="1">Deployment role</strong><span class="node-hint">Inspect grant<Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={11}/></span></button>
 <button class="graph-node gn-three" data-inspect="2" aria-pressed="false"><span class="node-icon target"><Icon name="database" size={25}/></span><span class="meta" data-node-type="2">CRITICAL ASSET</span><strong data-node-label="2">Production secrets</strong><span class="node-hint">Inspect asset<Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={11}/></span></button></div>
 <div class="path-caption"><Icon name="route" size={14}/><p data-path-caption>Potential read access to a sensitive resource</p><span class="graph-legend">Possible access · Not an incident</span></div></div>
 <div class="path-detail"><div class="inspector-heading"><span class="meta">PATH INSPECTOR</span><Icon name="adjustments-horizontal" size={16}/></div><span class="review-label">Needs review</span><h3 data-demo-title>Narrow the role’s access.</h3><p data-demo-description>The workload can assume a role with read access to production secrets. Confirm the trust relationship and resource scope.</p><div class="inspector-policy"><span class="meta">EFFECTIVE GRANT · SAMPLE</span><code data-policy>secrets:GetValue</code><span>Resource scope requires review</span></div><div class="demo-owner"><span>Owner</span><strong data-demo-owner>Platform engineering</strong></div><button class="button small" data-review>Review intervention <Icon name="arrow-right" size={16}/></button></div></div>
 <div class="graph-tour" hidden data-tour-panel><div><span class="meta" data-tour-count>01 / 04</span><strong data-tour-title>Start at the entry point.</strong><p data-tour-copy>Inspect what is reachable before assuming how it could be used.</p></div><div class="tour-actions"><button data-tour-back aria-label="Previous tour step"><Icon name="arrow-left" size={16}/></button><button data-tour-next>Next step<Icon name="arrow-right" size={15}/></button><button data-tour-close aria-label="Close guided tour">×</button></div></div><div class="intervention-preview" hidden data-intervention><div class="intervention-preview-heading"><Icon name="git-pull-request" size={20}/><div><strong>A smaller scope. A reviewable change.</strong><span>Illustrative proposal, not an applied fix.</span></div><button data-reset-demo>Reset view<Icon name="arrow-right" size={13}/></button></div><div class="scope-comparison"><div><span class="meta">BEFORE · BROAD SCOPE</span><code data-before-scope>production/secrets/*</code><span class="scope-bar scope-broad"></span></div><Icon name="arrow-right" size={20}/><div><span class="meta">PROPOSED · SPECIFIC SCOPE</span><code data-after-scope>application/config</code><span class="scope-bar scope-narrow"></span></div></div></div><div class="demo-result" aria-live="polite" data-demo-result><Icon name="info-circle" size={16}/><span>Explore the paths. Inspect a node. Review a proposed change. All data is illustrative.</span></div>
</div>
